<title>USA: TABLE - Mazda July US car sales rise.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Mazda July US car sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mazda Motor Corp</p>
<p>			Jul 1-31, 1997     Jul 1-31, 1996 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	     6,841	     6,735	     +1.6</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	   3,679	     3,796	     -3.1</p>
<p> Import Car		 8,431	     8,649	     -2.5</p>
<p> Import Truck	     1,413	     1,160	    +21.8</p>
<p>		  Jan 1-Jul 31, 1997 Jan 1-Jul 31, 1996 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	    53,948	    57,071	     -4.9</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	  22,601	    26,071	    -12.8</p>
<p> Import Car		57,431	    63,915	     -9.6</p>
<p> Import Truck	     8,252	     8,239	     +0.7</p>
<p>* Pct change based on daily selling rate. Sale days 26 in latest month vs 26, 179 for year to date vs 180 in year ago.</p>
</text>
